  text:
    en: What is this building in Warsaw?
    native: Co to za budynek w Warszawie?
  visual: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2c82f3c2d332f0a478f9f7cb7822cb51, type: 3}
  useImageAnswers: 0
  answers:
  - text:
      en: Office of Everything
      native: "Urz\u0105d Wszystkiego"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Concrete Monument to Ego
      native: Betonowy Pomnik Ego
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Palace of Culture and Science
      native: "Pa\u0142ac Kultury i Nauki"
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 1
  - text:
      en: Central Department Store XL
      native: Centralny Dom Towarowy XL
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  explanation:
    en: A 'gift' from Stalin. Some want to tear it down, some love it. It is the
      center of Warsaw.
    native: "Prezent od Stalina. Niekt\xF3rzy chc\u0105 go zburzy\u0107, inni kochaj\u0105.
      To centrum Warszawy."
